# Acceptance variant: both racers use the proven Dragster drive so stock Results resolves without the ~37,670-frame idle-P2 timeout.
# Ordinary two-player route with a decided first race, then the post-race 2P flow.
# start:duration:p1-mask:p2-mask (requires tools/patches/snesrecomp-dual-controller-input.patch).
# Frames < 1134: tests/input/two-player-first-race.input (P1 MIKE, P2 ANDREW, Crawler Dragster).
# 1194..3800: the P1 Dragster drive from tests/input/vs-challenger-route.input; P2 idles.
# Unlike VS, the race continues after P1 finishes and ends at the ~37670-frame timeout.
# Post-race advances are issued by tests/input/two-player-p1-win-observe.script.
